 "name_en": "Basic Credit Management (BD6)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Basic Credit Management (BD6)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiof53824fe9af8450dbda8e41eecd7738e\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof53824fe9af8450dbda8e41eecd7738e__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">The credit worthiness and payment behavior of your business partners has an immediate effect on the business results of your company. Efficient receivables and credit management reduces the risk of financial losses and helps you to optimize business relationships with your business partners. Basic Credit Management supports your company in the early determination of the risk of losses on receivables from your business partners and supports you in making credit decisions. Basic Credit Management checks the exposure against the current credit limit for the business partner. In addition, you can also perform other checks, such as oldest open item, maximum dunning level, or last payment. If the new order is blocked, the blocked order can be released or rejected by authorized staff.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof53824fe9af8450dbda8e41eecd7738e__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Calculate credit limit for new and existing customers</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Enter sales order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Check exposure against credit limit</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Manage blocked orders</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof53824fe9af8450dbda8e41eecd7738e__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Reduce risk of bad debt</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Focus on reliable and profitable customers</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Check creditworthiness quickly</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Accelerate the process of checking a customer credit limit</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>基本信用管理 (BD6)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loiof53824fe9af8450dbda8e41eecd7738e\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof53824fe9af8450dbda8e41eecd7738e__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">业务伙伴的信用度和付款行为，立即对公司的业务结果产生影响。高效的应收账款和信用管理降低了财务损失的风险，并帮助您优化与业务伙伴的业务关系。基本信用管理支持贵公司尽早确定来自业务伙伴的应收账款的损失风险，并支持您制定信用决策。基本信用管理根据业务伙伴的当前信用额度检查敞口。此外，您还可以执行其他检查，例如最早未清项目、最高催款级别或上次付款。如果新订单已冻结，授权员工可以下达或拒绝冻结的订单。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof53824fe9af8450dbda8e41eecd7738e__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">计算新客户和现有客户的信用额度</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">输入销售订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">根据信用额度检查敞口</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">管理冻结订单</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loiof53824fe9af8450dbda8e41eecd7738e__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">降低坏账风险</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">专注于可靠、可盈利的客户</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">快速检查信用度</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">加速检查客户信用额度的流程</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
